characterName":"鈴森 芽衣","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c132865"},"originalCharacterName":"鈴森 芽衣","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Little Devil Childhood Friend"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I'll make you fall in love with me for sure!\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Otonashi Sumiya's childhood friend, she has had a crush on him since she was young. Impulsive and not very smart, sometimes when she gets too positive, she makes mistake as well, but she properly reflects and tries hard to make up for it, a troublemaker who is difficult to hate."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She likes to tease others, and is fine with being teased if it is done by someone she likes. She also likes to look up and practice seduction techniques from the Internet."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c132865"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a5/a5803b8d52317689b8a9079be17ae3ddd6d3f7dd7c6dbfdd434bdaf5fd3e86f0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c7/c72653fadb0cebbdf189224155bc74d92f2a98c2aabfca382ca5cddb9b90342e.webp","width":205,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"夏和小","creatorId":"vndb:s8737","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8737","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8737","name":"藤田 茜","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:101719","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c159763","characterName":"水宮 莉愛","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c159763"},"originalCharacterName":"水宮 莉愛","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Classmate of the protagonist. She's a downer and a loner, and it's hard to tell what she's thinking. She's often late, and only puts effort into things that she's interested in."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She doesn't try to fit in, but she also doesn't cause any trouble for others, so it's not like she is bullied or ostracized. She just chooses to be a loner."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She doesn't get along with her father and currently lives alone. Her family is well off but she doesn't feel loved, which is where her tendency to avoid people stems from. However, in reality, she craves company and affection."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She likes cats because their way of being is so similar to her own, but cats don't seem to like her back (because of the similarity they see in her). The protagonist becomes the only thing she shows interest in after she witnesses him pick up an abandoned cat."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c159763"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bc/bcc92aff69c1d63611d14bb4a59daa30c1312082b84ac36d859bace649df17e6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/18/182b69230cdd849a836dd32ad6ce4d9cec2ffdea0fbe4c6ddf3a23d64d7126eb.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"桜乃 ひよ","creatorId":"vndb:s5178","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5178","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5178","name":"本多 真梨子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:101718","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c159811","characterName":"笹原 広斗","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c159811"},"originalCharacterName":"笹原 広斗","char